<p>
The {@code afRelationship} controls the {@code /AFRelationship} of the
associated-file entry (PDF/A-3, PDF 2.0). E-invoices (Factur-X/ZUGFeRD)
require the invoice XML to be attached as {@code "Alternative"}.
</p>

